{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"0aaf9b0009044387a940be446d07c060","title":"Permission","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V14","anchorList":[{"anchorId":"section521624103184524","level":"1","title":"Field Summary","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1613084812184524","level":"1","title":"Method Summary","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1166019327184524","level":"1","title":"Field Detail","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER","level":"2","title":"DEVICE_MANAGER","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY","level":"2","title":"NOTIFY","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__SENSOR","level":"2","title":"SENSOR","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1410013154017","level":"2","title":"MOTION_SENSOR","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1423182224014","level":"2","title":"WEAR_USER_STATUS","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section8848193515365","level":"2","title":"DEVICE_SN","parentId":"section1166019327184524","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1188419908184524","level":"1","title":"Method Detail","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__getName--","level":"2","title":"getName","parentId":"section1188419908184524","apiAtomic":0}],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234\"></a>  <h1>Permission</h1> <div id=\"body959486174184524\"><table class=\"simpletableborder\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__simpletable1285950301184524\"><tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__strow834508266184524\"><td id=\"stentry155903334184524\" valign=\"top\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p872512249184524\">java.lang.Object</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p365870584184524\">|---com.huawei.wearengine.auth.Permission</p> <pre id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__pre1956144839184524\">public class Permission\nextends java.lang.Object\nimplements android.os.Parcelable</pre> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p69936815416\">Wear Engine的权限对象，封装了Wear Engine指定的权限，当前包含DEVICE_MANAGER、MOTION_SENSOR、NOTIFY、SENSOR和WEAR_USER_STATUS权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p17169152817533\">申请权限的操作请参见开发指南。</p> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section521624103184524\"><a name=\"section521624103184524\"></a><a name=\"section521624103184524\"></a><h4>Field Summary</h4> <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__table1778037930184524\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row925027994184524\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.2.1.3.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1195169637184524\">Modifier and Type</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.2.1.3.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p138571867184524\">Field and Description</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row2118278492184524\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1538704416184524\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1196438242184524\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER\">DEVICE_MANAGER</a> 设备基础信息：扫描、配对、解配对设备；获取设备状态、可用空间、电量状态、充电状态；手机侧应用和穿戴设备侧应用双向传输消息和文件。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row4539133011512\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1591415383715\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p124961657133912\"><a href=\"#section1410013154017\">MOTION_SENSOR</a> 运动传感器：打开、关闭设备侧传感器，读取运动传感器数据，例如ACC、GYRO、MAG等。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row675616887184524\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p448795342184524\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p722871592184524\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY\">NOTIFY</a> 消息通知：发送模板化消息给设备；当使用NotifyClient相关的API的时候，需要申请该权限。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row1585434010184524\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p672835269184524\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1901599200184524\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__SENSOR\">SENSOR</a> 人体传感器：打开、关闭设备侧传感器，读取人体传感器数据，例如ECG、PPG等。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row416514459542\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p2767142823612\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p6605131383617\"><a href=\"#section1423182224014\">WEAR_USER_STATUS</a> 穿戴用户状态：查询和订阅用户佩戴状态；订阅用户心率告警。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row185167525017\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p75171457505\">static <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p35174515015\"><a href=\"#section8848193515365\">DEVICE_SN</a> 设备序列号：获取已配对穿戴设备的序列号。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1613084812184524\"><a name=\"section1613084812184524\"></a><a name=\"section1613084812184524\"></a><h4>Method Summary</h4> <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__table2143009866184524\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row260276214184524\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.2.1.3.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p655277466184524\">Modifier and Type</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.2.1.3.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p187720501184524\">Method and Description</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__row46761905184524\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p2044826163184524\">java.lang.String</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p495487247184524\"><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__getName--\">getName</a>() 获取权限名称。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1166019327184524\"><a name=\"section1166019327184524\"></a><a name=\"section1166019327184524\"></a><h4>Field Detail</h4></div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER\"></a><a name=\"DEVICE_MANAGER\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph1375148745184524\"></span>DEVICE_MANAGER</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1152446009184524\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> DEVICE_MANAGER</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p14235132613256\">设备基础信息：扫描、配对、解配对设备；获取设备状态、可用空间、电量状态、充电状态；手机侧应用和穿戴设备侧应用双向传输消息和文件。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1522743314252\">当使用DeviceClient、P2pClient、MonitorClient相关的API时，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p203777664184524\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1771251089184524\">API level 0 (SDK 5.0.0.301)</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p234991342184524\"></p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY\"></a><a name=\"NOTIFY\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph1172983050184524\"></span>NOTIFY</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1105678723184524\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> NOTIFY</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p114329164117\">消息通知：发送模板化消息给设备；当使用NotifyClient相关的API的时候，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p191214431369\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p12121443869\">API level 2 (SDK 5.0.1.300)</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p295902291184524\"></p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__SENSOR\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__SENSOR\"></a><a name=\"SENSOR\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph1736372123184524\"></span>SENSOR</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1231190746184524\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> SENSOR</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p830266152019\">人体传感器：打开、关闭设备侧传感器，读取传感器数据，例如ECG、PPG等。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p114549114111\">当使用SensorClient相关API的时候，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p10286741478\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p52861644712\">API level 2 (SDK 5.0.1.300)</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1818523665184524\"></p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1410013154017\"><a name=\"section1410013154017\"></a><a name=\"section1410013154017\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph1482911128400\"></span>MOTION_SENSOR</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p11527774415\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> MOTION_SENSOR</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p67861927113212\">运动传感器：打开、关闭设备侧传感器，读取运动传感器数据，例如ACC、GYRO、MAG等。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p212675004815\">当使用SensorClient相关API时，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p13126850194811\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p11126155013488\">API level 6 (SDK 5.0.1.302)</p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1423182224014\"><a name=\"section1423182224014\"></a><a name=\"section1423182224014\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph817093617404\"></span>WEAR_USER_STATUS</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p53886456409\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> WEAR_USER_STATUS</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p132688381409\">穿戴用户状态：查询和订阅用户佩戴状态；订阅用户心率告警。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p12851204393320\">当使用MonitorClient相关的API时，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p827223754519\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p2027273794518\">API level 6 (SDK 5.0.1.302)</p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section8848193515365\"><a name=\"section8848193515365\"></a><a name=\"section8848193515365\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph984773523610\"></span>DEVICE_SN</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p319643723717\">public static final <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005\">Permission</a> DEVICE_SN</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p384823523613\">设备序列号：获取已配对穿戴设备的序列号。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p484853516363\">当需要获取设备序列号时，需要申请该权限。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p16848113512360\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p138481735143611\">API level 11 (SDK 5.0.2.310)</p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1188419908184524\"><a name=\"section1188419908184524\"></a><a name=\"section1188419908184524\"></a><h4>Method Detail</h4></div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__getName--\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__getName--\"></a><a name=\"getName--\"></a><h4>[h2]<span id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__ph1510913706184524\"></span>getName</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1886695242184524\">public java.lang.String getName()</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p74714944110\">获取权限名称。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p15372778184524\"><strong>Returns:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p401819138184524\">权限名称</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p92091057976\"><strong>Since:</strong></p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1720915715715\">API level 0 (SDK 5.0.0.301)</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__p1643937105184524\"></p> </div> </div> <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-References","isImport":2,"tag":"10102004","fileName":"permission-0000001059433005","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2024-07-02 08:55:18","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"]}}